  "nameEn": "Around the Lake",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Go around the lake: on each side jump while you can. Repair sparking lamps and light them, light the dark ones, leave the shining ones. Turn right at a corner.",
  "descriptionEn": "The bridge goes around the lake along its perimeter. The lamps on it vary: some already shine, others are dark or sparking.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Go around the lake: on each side jump while you can. Only repair sparking lamps and turn off the ones that shine. Turn right at a corner."
